WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.520
Hi, my name is Mateo Robles.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:05.020
My path from sociology to computer science

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:09.740
shapes how I think about leadership, teamwork, and coordinating AI agents:

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:13.680
clear goals, careful handoffs, and checking what works.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.120
Here's what that looks like.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:19.500
Gyre turns mathematics into live, interactive art in your browser.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.240
In SyberWork, I contributed the GitHits client and guarded integration, with
fixture-based testing.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:31.620
In RISE, I contributed to the shared Composer stack, helping preserve reliable
playback and themes.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:38.220
I'm open to software engineering, technical support, product or associate product
management, and implementation roles.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.960
I'm curious, adaptable, and ready to learn with your team.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.320
If you see a fit, invite me to interview.

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:47.400
Let's build something useful together.
